OL,3,AMI5 will need proof to be believed in
OL,4,Afuture, says Leveson after BBC
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe man responsible for overseeing the
OL,8,Fconduct of MI5 has said it will now
OL,9,Fhave to provide proof to be believed by
OL,10,Fjudges, after a BBC News investigation
OL,11,Fexposed how the security service lied
OL,12,Fto three courts.
OL,14,FLord Leveson, the investigatory powers
OL,15,Fcommissioner and a former Court of
OL,16,FAppeal justice, said that as a judge
OL,17,F"if the security service said something
OL,18,Fto me, then I would accept it".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
