OL,3,AMI5 will need proof to be believed in
OL,4,Afuture, says Leveson after BBC
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut he said courts would now be "far
OL,8,Fmore reluctant to accept, without
OL,9,Fevidential proof, things that are said
OL,10,Fin the future".
OL,12,FLord Leveson praised the impact of the
OL,13,FBBC's investigation into an abusive MI5
OL,14,Fagent, which he said had led to changes
OL,15,Fin how informants are managed.
